					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 110291002,
					"content": "（香爐表面沒有灰塵…）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110291013
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 110291013,
					"content": "…這應該不是盜寶團留下的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110291004
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 110291004,
					"content": "…香爐中點的，似乎是驅逐魔物用的薰香。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110291005
					],
					"speakerTitle": "白朮"
				},
				{
					"id": 110291005,
					"content": "驅逐魔物？可是我們剛剛不是還遇到了一群嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110291006
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 110291006,
					"content": "薰香已經燃盡多日。而方才遇到的魔物，恐怕，是被更深處的「某物」吸引而至的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110291007
					],
					"speakerTitle": "白朮"
				},
				{
					"id": 110291007,
					"content": "想必當初開鑿此洞的盜寶團，也是在深處與「它」不期而遇，才匆匆棄洞逃亡。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110291008
					],
					"speakerTitle": "白朮"
				},
				{
					"id": 110291008,
					"content": "後來師姐又發現了這裡，將「它」視作醫治嘉良的救命稻草…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110291009
					],
					"speakerTitle": "白朮"
				},
				{
					"id": 110291009,
					"content": "對了…這香爐…這香爐是江蘺的東西！…沒錯，就是在這裡！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110291010
					],
					"speakerTitle": "嘉良"
				},
				{
					"id": 110291010,
					"content": "就是在這裡…我讓江蘺…是我讓她…對我下了…咳！咳咳！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110291011
					],
					"speakerTitle": "嘉良"
				},
				{
					"id": 110291011,
					"content": "——嘉良！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110291012
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 110291012,
					"content": "我沒事…繼續往下吧。我能感覺到，她…就在下面等我。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "嘉良"
				},
				{
					"id": 110291003,
					"content": "（內壁有新燃的痕跡…）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110291013
					]
				}
